# `license:` is deliberately absent. CFF 1.2.0 requires it to be a strict SPDX
# enum id, and `LicenseRef-*` / "All Rights Reserved" are not members, so the
# spec's own fallback applies: state the terms by URL only. An earlier revision
# carried `license: LicenseRef-AllRightsReserved`, which is not a legal value --
# and the gate that was supposed to catch it printed the illegal string in a PASS
# line, because that revision of the gate had no enum check. Both are fixed here.
license-url: "https://github.com/zhaoxinghua09-cell/uibc-competition/blob/main/LICENSE"
keywords:
  - UIBC
  - autonomy
  - benchmark
  - competition
  - specification
